    ],
    "text": "The matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013 \u201cWhether Mr. L.P. Jayasundara working as Deputy General Manager (Human Resources and Administration) of the Central Engineering Consultancy Bureau had been caused injustice by,",
